EXISTS
-------
IT IS UNARY OPERATOR USED TO INCREASE THE EFFICIENCY OF CORELATED SUBQUERY RETURNS TRUE IF SUBQUERY RETURNS ANY VALUE.


SELECT DNAME 
FROM DEPT
WHERE  EXISTS (SELECT DEPTNO
                 FROM EMP 
                 WHERE EMP.DEPTNO=DEPT.DEPTNO);

NOT EXISTS
-----------
IT IS UNARY OPERATOR USED TO INCREASE THE EFFICIENCY OF CORELATED SUBQUERY RETURNS TRUE IF SUBQUERY NOT RETURNS ANY VALUE.


SELECT DNAME 
FROM DEPT
WHERE  NOT EXISTS (SELECT DEPTNO
                 FROM EMP 
                 WHERE EMP.DEPTNO=DEPT.DEPTNO);


