3)🔹 LENGTH():
++++++++++++++

RETURNS NUMBER OF CHARACTERS.

Syntax:

SELECT LENGTH(string);

Example:

SELECT LENGTH('SNOWFLAKE');
-- 9


4)🔹 SUBSTR()
+++++++++++++

SUBRACT THE PART OF STRING.

Syntax:

SELECT SUBSTR(string, start_position, [length]);

Examples:

SELECT SUBSTR('BANANA', 4, 5);
-- ANA

SELECT SUBSTR('BANANA', -5, 2);
-- AN

SELECT SUBSTR('SNOWFLAKE', 1, 4);
-- SNOW


